{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom Dwellers is a cozy little aquarium that sits at the bottom of your screen. Collect and grow different fishes, discover shrimps and decorate your tank while you work or play on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/f0e7b960157e6c781816b14f0a37e3bf.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/b8eef6fac2149ecc1cc19901e1111236.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimps are friends, not food! Unlock these shrimps and put them to work. Collect coins, feed fish, <span class=\"bb_strike\">file your taxes</span> and hold a concert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/43c477a6d4af1752984fdb446541ed84.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what else your fishes need? Plants! And rocks. And more plants. Oh and corals too. Decorations go brr and tank happiness go brr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/c5556c90b05c1a5ea097913dcd7f5f3b.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woah wait whats that?? Invasion mode lets you have some unruly &quot;friends&quot; over. You can disable this in the options to have a perfectly peaceful tank. No shark attacks, promise!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762300?t=1758556222","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762300?t=1758556222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/4d0e85876368f1902ec152e09236133fa4467002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758556222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/4d0e85876368f1902ec152e09236133fa4467002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758556222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom Dwellers is a cozy little aquarium that sits at the bottom of your screen. Collect and grow different fishes, discover shrimps and decorate your tank while you work or play on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/f0e7b960157e6c781816b14f0a37e3bf.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/b8eef6fac2149ecc1cc19901e1111236.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimps are friends, not food! Unlock these shrimps and put them to work. Collect coins, feed fish, <span class=\"bb_strike\">file your taxes</span> and hold a concert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/43c477a6d4af1752984fdb446541ed84.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what else your fishes need? Plants! And rocks. And more plants. Oh and corals too. Decorations go brr and tank happiness go brr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/c5556c90b05c1a5ea097913dcd7f5f3b.avif?t=1758556222\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woah wait whats that?? Invasion mode lets you have some unruly &quot;friends&quot; over. You can disable this in the options to have a perfectly peaceful tank. No shark attacks, promise!</p>","developers":["JustWastingTime"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/f8d678072f0248bac5c449b1008d4cc446ded960/header.jpg?t=1758556222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Bottom Dwellers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</l